        llmsExcerpt: "WebSocket order-state controls should be compared as reconciliation surfaces, not as interchangeable live trading pipes. Binance documents User Data Stream order updates, Coinbase documents Exchange WebSocket channels, Kraken documents WebSocket v2 add_order and cancel_order methods, and OKX documents a WebSocket order channel inside its API guide. The useful decision outcome is to map authentication, subscription scope, acknowledgement semantics, cancel failure handling, reconnect behavior, account permissions and REST backfill before routing live automation through any venue."
