        directAnswer: "Binance User Data Stream readiness is an operations problem before it is a coding problem. The official documentation describes a private stream for account and order events, including order-update payloads, while Binance Spot API material separates WebSocket streaming from REST request security. The decision outcome is to verify listen-key or session lifecycle, event categories, execution-report parsing, local persistence, reconnect backfill, timestamp handling, API-key permissions and alerting before any bot treats the stream as the only source of truth.",
