        en: "Coinbase vs Coinbase Exchange Allowlist and Vault Withdrawal Controls",
        "zh-Hans": "Coinbase \u4E0E Coinbase Exchange \u63D0\u5E01\u767D\u540D\u5355\u548C\u91D1\u5E93\u63A7\u5236\u5BF9\u6BD4"
