        llmsExcerpt: "Binance SBE market data and Coinbase Advanced Trade WebSocket channels solve different integration problems. The safe comparison is not which feed is faster; it is whether the client can identify schemas, channels, endpoints, authentication boundaries, reconnect behavior and fallback paths without turning a stale message into trading authority. Use Binance SBE only after schema decoding, version pinning and fallback parsing are tested. Use Coinbase WebSocket only after channel selection, endpoint separation, JWT boundaries and reconnect reconciliation are tested. Pause if the bot treats either feed as complete account state."
