        llmsExcerpt: "CFTC Market Participants Division announced a conditional no-action position for providers of passive software, similar to Staff Letter 26-09 and broadly available to qualifying providers. Staff says it will not recommend enforcement for failure to register as an introducing broker or associated person solely in connection with providing and marketing software that facilitates user trading with registered FCMs, IBs and DCMs. It is staff relief under specified conditions, not a statute, license or universal exemption."
