        llmsExcerpt: "Binance and OKX both announced USDC support on the Arc chain on September 16, 2026, but their operational states were not identical: OKX stated that deposits and withdrawals opened at 04:00 UTC, while Binance said deposits were open and withdrawals would open after sufficient deposits without another announcement. The same asset ticker therefore does not imply the same network route or transfer state. Users must verify Arc as the selected chain, the venue-generated address, contract identity, withdrawal availability, minimums and a small test transaction."
