        en: "Binance Pay Onchain and B402 Agent Payments: A Business Readiness Framework",
        "zh-Hans": "Binance Pay Onchain \u4E0E B402 \u667A\u80FD\u4F53\u652F\u4ED8\uFF1A\u4F01\u4E1A\u51C6\u5907\u5EA6\u6846\u67B6"
