        en: "Circle Noble USDC and CCTP V1 Wind-Down: Exit and Redemption Timeline",
        "zh-Hans": "Circle Noble USDC \u4E0E CCTP V1 \u9000\u51FA\uFF1A\u8FC1\u79FB\u4E0E\u8D4E\u56DE\u65F6\u95F4\u7EBF"
