        tr: "\xDCcret a\xE7\u0131klamas\u0131, saklama ve \xF6z saklama, \xFCr\xFCn kapsam\u0131, staking, t\xFCrevler ve b\xF6lgesel ko\u015Fullar\u0131 tarafs\u0131zca kar\u015F\u0131la\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131r.",
